  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the whole wheat pastry flour, vegan butter, and salt to make the crust.",
    "Gradually add cold water to the bowl and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Roll out the dough and place it in a tart pan.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together the black treacle, brown sugar, lemon juice, and vanilla extract to make the filling.",
    "Pour the filling into the tart crust.",
    "Arrange the katsuramuki-cut apples on top of the filling.",
    "Bake the tart in the preheated oven for 40 minutes.",
    "Remove the tart from the oven and let it cool before serving."
